      "id": "gpu_fp64",
      "name": "FP64 汎用（非行列）",
      "unit": "TFLOPS",
      "direction": "higher",
      "note": "ベンダー共通の非行列FP64ピーク。NVIDIA CUDAコア、AMD Vector/VALUを同じ行で比較する。Tensor/Matrix FP64とは別行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "gpu_fp32",
      "name": "FP32 汎用（非行列）",
      "unit": "TFLOPS",
      "direction": "higher",
      "note": "ベンダー共通の非行列FP32ピーク（FMA=2演算）。NVIDIA CUDAコア、AMD Vector（CDNAは通常命令、RDNA3.5はAMD慣例のdual-issue値）。packed/single-issue等の命令条件付き値は各GPUの注記に記載。"
    },
    {
      "id": "gpu_fp16",
      "name": "FP16 汎用（非行列）",
      "unit": "TFLOPS",
      "direction": "higher",
      "note": "packed FP16を含む非行列FP16ピーク。Tensor/Matrix/WMMAとは別行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "matrix_fp32_dense",
      "name": "Matrix FP32 / Dense",
      "unit": "TFLOPS",
      "direction": "higher",
      "note": "IEEE FP32入力・FP32蓄積の行列演算（AMD MFMA FP32等）。TF32入力とは別行。NVIDIAはIEEE FP32入力のTensor MMAがないためx。"
